      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "logseq_get_concept_evolution",
    "title": "Get Concept Evolution",
  },
  {
    "annotations": {
      "destructiveHint": false,
      "idempotentHint": true,
      "openWorldHint": false,
      "readOnlyHint": true,
      "title": "Get Concept Network",
    },
    "description": "Get network of pages related to a concept with nodes and edges for visualization.

**When to use:**
- To visualize how pages are connected in the knowledge graph
- Understanding the relationship structure around a concept
- Finding connected pages up to N hops away
- When the user asks "show me how X relates to other topics"

**Output:**
- Follows links in both directions. One edge per page pair, with a reference count (outbound/inbound)
- Capped at 50 pages (15 new pages per page); journal pages are shown but not expanded. If \`truncated\` is true, the strongest connections were kept and the rest were dropped. Raise \`max_nodes\` / \`max_fanout\` or set \`expand_journals\` for a wider network

**Alternatives:**
- Use logseq_build_context for detailed content with related pages (less structural)
- Use logseq_get_backlinks for simpler inbound link queries (no network structure)
- Use logseq_search_by_relationship for specific relationship patterns",
    "inputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "concept_name": {
          "description": "Name of the root concept",
          "type": "string",
        },
        "expand_journals": {
          "default": false,
          "description": "Expand through journal pages instead of treating them as leaves (default: false). Journal pages link to almost everything, so this can flood the network.",
          "type": "boolean",
        },
        "max_depth": {
          "default": 2,
          "description": "Maximum depth to traverse (default: 2, max: 3)",
          "type": "number",
        },
        "max_fanout": {
          "default": 15,
          "description": "Maximum new pages any one page may add (default: 15, max: 100)",
          "type": "number",
        },
        "max_nodes": {
          "default": 50,
          "description": "Maximum pages in the network, root included (default: 50, max: 500)",
          "type": "number",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "concept_name",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "logseq_get_concept_network",
    "title": "Get Concept Network",
  },
  {
